The FLiPS **data and derived features** released alongside this repository are
licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)**.
The full text is in [`../LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`](../LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

## What this covers

The members enumerated in [`manifest.sha256`](manifest.sha256):

- `Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/` — the in-repo, zero-download CPU smoke
  subset (committed in this repository).
- `Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_run/` — 12-model FLIPS dev slice (re-classifiable;
  backs the out-of-box tier).
- `Productions/LLMmap_ICML_run/` — 205-class LLMmap traces (backs the LLMmap E3 arm).
- `Productions/answers_2/` — full-grid quantized answers (2 of 4 models).
- `Productions/FLiPS_ICML_quantized/` — temp=0.2 quantization coverage gap.
- `Productions/Intersection_vocab/` — tokenizer-vocabulary intersection (tracked
  in-repo; an import-time dependency, not a downloadable archive).
- `Productions/FLiPS_ICML_run/` — the off-disk headline run (released separately;
  see [`README.md`](README.md)).

These are computed bit-sequence features and classification artefacts derived from
model outputs. Our contribution over them (feature tables, manifests, the light
subset) is offered under CC-BY-4.0.

## Per-model output constraints layered ON TOP

The released members are derived from the **outputs** of third-party models whose
terms flow through to those derivations. CC-BY-4.0 governs our packaging; the
underlying model outputs additionally carry the originating model's terms, notably:

- **Cohere (`CohereForAI/c4ai-command-r-plus`, `c4ai-command-r-v01`)** — outputs are
  governed by **CC-BY-NC 4.0** (non-commercial). Any redistribution or use of the
  Cohere-derived rows is restricted to non-commercial use.
- **Google Gemma (`google/gemma-2-9b-it`, `gemma-2-27b-it`)** — outputs are subject to
  the **Gemma Terms of Use** and Prohibited Use Policy.

When in doubt about a specific model's derived rows, defer to the **stricter** of
CC-BY-4.0 and that model's originating terms.

## Model weights

**Model weights are NOT redistributed** by this project. Only derived bit-sequence
features / classification artefacts are released. Obtain weights from their original
sources (Hugging Face Hub) under their own licenses.
